mber of feature_063 context scans and the exhaustion of independent validation capacity, repeated narrow subgroup probing would increase multiplicity and is unlikely to change the scientific conclusion; I therefore close them while retaining the broader accepted conditional feature_063 findings from feature_027=0 and pre-specified core contexts. I also closed H216 and H217 because the available evidence is near or below threshold and further feature_003 subgroup fragmentation is not productive. Validation capacity is exhausted, so no validation request is made. The next focused discovery checks should test whether the conditional feature_063 lower-outcome signal persists within feature_027=0 while conditioning separately on strong positive or negative predictors feature_010=1, feature_037=1, and feature_002=1; these are robustness scope checks, not adjusted or causal tests.",
